Run stage gate via Bash: `acorn _internal validate-stage "__SPEC_PATH__" __MODE__ 1`.
If rc=1, relaunch ONLY failed agent(s), wait `__RETRY_BACKOFF__` seconds between retries, and retry up to `__RETRY_BUDGET__` times per agent.
